---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="페이지를 찾을 수 없음" description="요청하신 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.">
  <section
    class="container-page flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col items-center justify-center py-section text-center"
  >
    <div class="not-found-mark mb-8" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="72" height="72" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <g fill="var(--color-primary)">
          <path d="M50,50 L54.5,32 L50,8 L45.5,32 Z"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L53,40 L50,22 L47,40 Z" transform="rotate(45 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L54.5,32 L50,8 L45.5,32 Z" transform="rotate(90 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L53,40 L50,22 L47,40 Z" transform="rotate(135 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L54.5,32 L50,8 L45.5,32 Z" transform="rotate(180 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L53,40 L50,22 L47,40 Z" transform="rotate(225 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L54.5,32 L50,8 L45.5,32 Z" transform="rotate(270 50 50)"></path>
          <path d="M50,50 L53,40 L50,22 L47,40 Z" transform="rotate(315 50 50)"></path>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <span class="caption-uppercase text-muted">404</span>
    <h1 class="display-mega mt-4">이 페이지는 없어요</h1>
    <p class="body-md mt-5 max-w-md text-balance text-body">
      하지만 가장 흥미로운 글은<br />종종 예상치 못한 곳에서 시작되곤 하죠.
    </p>

    <a
      href="/"
      class="mt-9 inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 text-[0.9375rem] font-medium text-canvas transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
    >
      단로그로 돌아가기
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found-mark svg {
    animation: not-found-spin 40s linear infinite;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .not-found-mark svg {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  @keyframes not-found-spin {
    to {
      transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
  }
</style>
